  "term": "sexual instinct",
  "definition": "Sexual instinct refers to the mental drive or energy linked to sexuality in a broad sense, including seeking pleasure and a loved or desired object. The term can also be used more broadly for psychic energy connected with instincts that motivate behavior.",
